    <DataNode elementId="AT5G03860-MONOMER" textLabel="malate synthase" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q9LZC3" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="300" centerY="215" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">&lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt; mutants defective in this gene were shown to lack malate synthase activity |CITS:[15272001]|. It was shown that, in the mutants, compared to the levels incorporated in wild type, 60% of &lt;sup&gt;14&lt;/sup&gt;C from radiolabeled acetate was incorporated into sugars and twice as much &lt;sup&gt;14&lt;/sup&gt;CO&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt; was released |CITS:[15272001]|.</Comment>
